	<section_number>6.2-1325</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fiscal year</catch_line>
	<text>
		The fiscal year of every credit union shall end at the close of business on December 31.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 6-218; 1956, c. 90; 1966, c. 584, § 6.1-209; 1968, c. 560; 1984, c. 353; 1990, c. 373, § 6.1-225.18; 2010, c. 794.</history>
